{
  "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-flowleap-deliverables",
  "description": "FlowLeap deliverable tools: write_patent_results with the Patent AI report templates, evidence validation against the session's recorded tool results, the working record, the evidence ledger and the delivery card; export_draft_docx and inventor_questions with the Application Drafting layer and the Word builders; start_application_draft, validate_draft and remove_claim with the attorney gates as question cards and slash commands; ported from flowleap-agent-v2 onto the dsh filesystem, tool-result, storage, model, user-questions, approval and command seams",
